justify; line-height: 115%;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">Dur&eacute;e&nbsp;:</span></strong><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\"> 3 ans (6 semestres)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: 115%;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">Objectif de la formation&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%;\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">&middot;</span><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 7.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">Forme des techniciens sp&eacute;cialis&eacute;s dans les syst&egrave;mes m&eacute;catroniques et dans leur int&eacute;gration, tout en le rendant aptes &agrave; r&eacute;parer et remettre en &eacute;tat les parties endommag&eacute;es des carrosseries et les garnitures int&eacute;rieures des v&eacute;hicules automobiles ainsi que leurs &eacute;l&eacute;ments en verres par l&rsquo;ex&eacute;cution de diff&eacute;rentes t&acirc;ches de r&eacute;paration, de remplacement, d&rsquo;inspection, de d&eacute;bosselage, de redressement et d&rsquo;application de toutes sortes.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: 115%;\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none;\">Un syst&egrave;me m&eacute;catronique a pour finalit&eacute; une action physique r&eacute;alis&eacute;e par un m&eacute;canisme. Ces syst&egrave;mes, pour r&eacute;pondre &agrave; la complexit&eacute; croissante des actions, int&egrave;grent intimement trois technologies d&egrave;s la conception : la m&eacute;canique, l\'&eacute;lectronique et l&rsquo;informatique.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: 115%;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">Fili&egrave;re&nbsp;:</span></strong><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\"> <a name=\"_Hlk153110145\"></a><strong>M&eacute;canique des engins de chantier et Agricole (MECA)</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: 115%;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">Dur&eacute;e&nbsp;:</span></strong><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\"> 3 ans (6 semestres)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: 115%;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">Objectif de la formation&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: 115%;\"><span lang=\"FR\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ligatures: none; mso-fareast-language: DE;\">Apprendre aux futurs techniciens et techniciennes &agrave; entretenir et r&eacute;parer diff&eacute;rents types de machineries de chantiers, dont des tracteurs, des niveleuses et des chargeurs. Les m&eacute;caniciens et m&eacute;caniciennes travaillent principalement sur des chantiers de construction ou en atelier.</span></p>', '<p s