e concours &eacute;crit, organis&eacute; pour l&rsquo;acc&egrave;s en G&eacute;nie Industriel et Logistique.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-indent: -14.2pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo5; margin: 0cm 0cm 0cm 21.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"FR-CM\" style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-ansi-language: FR-CM;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"FR-CM\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ansi-language: FR-CM;\">Licence acad&eacute;mique (<span style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Physique, Informatique, Chimie</span>), Licence de Technologie (<s>LI</s>, GIM, GEII, GMP), et Licence en sciences de l&rsquo;ing&eacute;nieur</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span lang=\"FR-CM\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ansi-language: FR-CM;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span lang=\"FR-CM\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ansi-language: FR-CM;\">Poursuite des &eacute;tudes</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"FR-CM\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ansi-language: FR-CM; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Une poursuite d\'&eacute;tudes est possible pour les &eacute;tudiants visant un Master recherche et un Doctorat PhD. Les travaux de recherche peuvent &ecirc;tre men&eacute;s en partenariat avec une entreprise ou un organisme public.</span></p>\